  "name": "Ash",
  "subtitle": "every Ash's planet",
  "story": "The air on Ash is full of static, and kind words set it off. A small one crackles. A proper one, the kind people only say a handful of times in a life, sets the whole hillside alight. So people here keep it light: the weather, the football, a dig about your haircut. Mick and Tony are brothers and have got by on insults since the playground. Then Tony became a dad, and Mick, in the hospital car park, said, 'You'll be brilliant.' The fire brigade said it was the best one they'd seen all year. Mick lost an eyebrow. Worth it.",
